      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Pushing unCanny Chroma toward believable amateur realism — candid, imperfect, and strikingly lifelike photos that feel like real snapshots. Although, it is very versatile. :) \n\nHere’s some links you’ll need; If you have used models related to Flux, then you probably don't need to download them again.\n\n## diffusion_models\n\n[UnCanny Photorealistic Chroma Finetune](https://civitai.com/models/2086389?modelVersionId=2517681)\n\n\n## text_encoders\n\n[t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors)\n\n## vae\n\n[ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Lumina_Image_2.0_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)\n\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├─ 📂 models/\n│   ├─ 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │     ├── uncannyPhotorealism_v13.safetensors\n│   ├─ 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │     ├── t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\n│   └─ 📂 vae/\n│            └──  ae.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
